    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The electric cables are shredded to optimise the subsequent mechanical separation of the copper from the rubber, and both fractions are then sent for recovery. On average, the cables are composed of 70% rubber and 30% copper.  &#13;
&#13;
